From: Matthias Körber <koerber@google.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 02:40:05 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] [OTP] Enforce field-level and form-level OTP eligibility checks (base)

Introduce OtpFieldDetector::IsOtpField to centralize field-level OTP
eligibility (focusable, non-password ONE_TIME_CODE field that is
same-site with the main frame origin).

Update OtpFieldDetector::IsOtpForm to verify same-site origin matching
across all ONE_TIME_CODE fields in a form before filtering for focusable
non-password fields, and validate the triggering field in
OtpManagerImpl::GetOtpSuggestions.

This applies the base (non-legacy) part of CL 8499574 so that it can be
cleanly backmerged to older branches where the legacy implementation
does not exist.

